 "nl": [
  "Block RDP (TCP 3389), MySQL (TCP 3306) from backup to dev-lab; the rest of TCP ports 1024-65535 between them is allowed.",
  "Apart from guest-wifi on HTTPS (TCP 443); guest-wifi on DNS over UDP 53, all traffic originating in ntp-servers must be dropped.",
  "Allow voip to connect to backup using IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "No packet from engineering may enter guest-wifi, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Hosts in ntp-servers may reach engineering over SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Permit TCP ports 1024-65535 from vpn-users to ntp-servers but deny PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), RDP (TCP 3389), MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "dev-lab must never reach vpn-users, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Allow voip to connect to dns-servers using SMTP (TCP 25).",
  "No packet from finance may enter dev-lab, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Permit any UDP port from backup to vpn-users but deny SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "ntp-servers must never reach engineering, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) and HTTPS (TCP 443) on dns-servers reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Restrict dev-lab so that its only permitted destinations are voip on HTTPS (TCP 443); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "engineering offers HTTP (TCP 80) and DNS over UDP 53 to every zone.",
  "Allow finance to connect to partners using RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "Apart from backup on NTP (UDP 123), all traffic originating in engineering must be dropped."
 ],
